<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοργ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>love, affection</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				109.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				<u>Fr.</u>
				73
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνησίων πολιτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BMus.Inscr.</u>
					4.481
				</span></i>
			*.<i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Ephesus</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2802
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aphrodisias</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχόμενος τῆς εἰς δὲ ἀεὶ στοργῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1766.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; esp. of parents and children, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδύ γε πατὴρ τέκνοισιν, εἰ στοργὴν
					ἔχοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philem.
					200
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γονέων πρὸς ἔκγονα ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1100d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				10.8.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. φυσικὴ πρὸς τὰ τέκνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.Lac.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1012.44
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				4.378
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> rarely
				<i>sexual love,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.165
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				190
			</span></i> (Id.), <i><span class="en">
				7.476
			</span></i> (Id.).</div>
